---
// Ambiance.astro - Ambiance and artisanal craft section highlighting Sector 104 space
---

<section class="ambiance-section" aria-labelledby="ambiance-heading">
  <div class="ambiance-container">
    <div class="ambiance-card">
      <div class="ambiance-visual">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/images/cafe-interior.webp" type="image/webp" />
          <img
            src="/images/cafe-interior.jpg"
            alt="Warm modern interior of Morrow Café in Sector 104 with espresso bar and wooden seating"
            width="1024"
            height="702"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="ambiance-img"
          />
        </picture>
      </div>

      <div class="ambiance-content">
        <span class="ambiance-eyebrow">The Morrow Experience</span>
        <h2 id="ambiance-heading" class="ambiance-title">
          A slower pace in Sector 104
        </h2>
        <p class="ambiance-text">
          We built Morrow Café as a retreat from city rush. From small-batch beans roasted to highlight regional notes to butter-laminated morning croissants, everything is crafted with care and patience.
        </p>

        <ul class="highlights-list" role="list">
          <li class="highlight-item">
            <span class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <span>Single-origin estate coffees & micro-lots</span>
          </li>
          <li class="highlight-item">
            <span class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <span>House-baked sourdough, viennoiserie & toasts</span>
          </li>
          <li class="highlight-item">
            <span class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <span>Sunlit reading corners & dog-friendly outdoor patio</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ambiance-section {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4);
  }

  .ambiance-container {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ambiance-card {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ambiance-visual {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-subtle);
  }

  .ambiance-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ambiance-content {
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .ambiance-eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .ambiance-title {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .ambiance-text {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: var(--line-height-normal);
  }

  .highlights-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .highlight-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .check-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background-color: var(--color-success-bg);
    color: var(--color-success);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .ambiance-section {
      padding: var(--space-10) var(--space-6);
    }

    .ambiance-content {
      padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-6);
    }

    .ambiance-title {
      font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    }

    .ambiance-text {
      font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ambiance-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .ambiance-visual {
      height: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: auto;
    }

    .ambiance-content {
      padding: var(--space-10) var(--space-8);
      gap: var(--space-4);
    }
  }
</style>
